      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何的公司最近天天晚上加班。",
      "traditional": "小何的公司最近天天晚上加班。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé de gōng sī zuì jìn tiān tiān wǎn shang jiā bān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "突然有一天晚上，公司停电了。",
      "traditional": "突然有一天晚上，公司停電了。",
      "pinyin": "tū rán yǒu yì tiān wǎn shang gōng sī tíng diàn le",
      "english": "Little He's company recently has overtime work every evening."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "大家都很高兴，因为不用加班，可以回家了。",
      "traditional": "大家都很高興，因為不用加班，可以回家了。",
      "pinyin": "dà jiā dōu hěn gāo xìng yīn wèi bú yòng jiā bān kě yǐ huí jiā le",
      "english": "Suddenly one day in the evening, the company had a power failure."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "接着，第二天，第三天晚上也是一样，一到8点就停电。",
      "traditional": "接著，第二天，第三天晚上也是一樣，一到8點就停電。",
      "pinyin": "jiē zhe dì èr tiān dì sān tiān wǎn shang yě shì yí yàng yí dào 1 diǎn jiù tíng diàn",
      "english": "Everyone got happy, because it meant they didn't have to work overtime, and could go home."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Following this, the same thing happened the following two days. When the clock hit 8, the power went out."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "第四天晚上8点，公司又停电了。",
      "traditional": "第四天晚上8點，公司又停電了。",
