      "english": "On the fourth day at 8 o'clock, the company once again had a power failure."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This time, Manager Wang got angry, and shouted: “Nobody leave! Say it! Who among you is playing these tricks?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "大家你看看我，我看看你，不知道是谁做的好事。",
      "traditional": "大家你看看我，我看看你，不知道是誰做的好事。",
