    "sentence_translations": [
      "Who's Playing Tricks?",
      "",
      "Little He's company recently has overtime work every evening.",
      "Suddenly one day in the evening, the company had a power failure.",
      "Everyone got happy, because it meant they didn't have to work overtime, and could go home.",
      "Following this, the same thing happened the following two days. When the clock hit 8, the power went out.",
      "",
      "On the fourth day at 8 o'clock, the company once again had a power failure.",
      "This time, Manager Wang got angry, and shouted: “Nobody leave! Say it! Who among you is playing these tricks?”",
      "",
      "Everyone looked at each other, and didn't know who was doing this good deed.",
      "",
      "Suddenly, a female high pitch voice said loudly: “It was me!”",
      "When Manager Wang saw who it was, he was no longer angry and asked: “Mom, how, how come it's you?”",
      "",
      "Manager Wang's mother said:",
      "“You just work overtime every day! You've already been married for two years, I want a grandchild!”"
    ]
  }
